{"unit_id":"hyperMoss__dsh-diary#card-en","repo":"hyperMoss/dsh-diary","commit":"893a8df5e3e690ad44de4774099bbe3e2bec7e56","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-diary adds Markdown diary tools and a web board to DSH. Users can create, read, filter, update, delete, and search dated entries, and manage reusable templates. Entries are local Markdown files under DSH_HOME or ~/.dsh by default. The board groups entries by month; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:65-75","src/index.ts:476-550","src/client/index.ts:86-99","src/client/DiaryBoard.tsx:113-150"]}
